# Governs the one build whose context is the repository root: the Platform Portal
# (apps/admin-portal/Dockerfile). services/api has its own, next to its own context.
#
# Without this the whole tree — history included — is uploaded, and `COPY packages packages`
# copies whatever node_modules the host happens to have. On a CI runner that directory does not
# exist yet and the build works by luck; on a laptop it buries the install done inside the image
# under binaries built for the wrong platform.

.git
.github

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

.claude
.agents
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
